									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Hell is full of souls worth saving. Hell Healers is a survival action roguelite about turning a battlefield of enemies into a growing band of allies.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Turn the horde to your side</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/6dd26da2356779a89acddba994f3408d.poster.avif?t=1793137889" width=616 height=308 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/6dd26da2356779a89acddba994f3408d.webm?t=1793137889" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/6dd26da2356779a89acddba994f3408d.mp4?t=1793137889" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every purification changes the fight. Break the corruption gripping your enemies and recruit companions who help you push back the next wave.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Aim your abilities, dodge incoming attacks, and time your healing and protection as the pressure builds.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Combine blessings, ability evolutions and allied companions to shape your run.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Turn a desperate fight into a chain of purifications.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Find your kind of miracle</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/dc4348fd5499761dd5b8d9c09bae504e.poster.avif?t=1793137889" width=616 height=308 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/dc4348fd5499761dd5b8d9c09bae504e.webm?t=1793137889" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/dc4348fd5499761dd5b8d9c09bae504e.mp4?t=1793137889" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Discover a roster of 20 distinct healers with their own combat mechanics. Grow Briar Matron's living garden, weave the Threadkeeper's stitch network, or redirect Mirror Saint's beams through reflections.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Get close with sweeping melee attacks or control the fight from range.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Build around roses, mirrors, spirits, resonance, heat and more.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Complete challenges to unlock healers and record your discoveries in the Book of Miracles.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Every arena has its own demands</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/ad3f32604091bd40ec85ed9280e11814.poster.avif?t=1793137889" width=616 height=308 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/ad3f32604091bd40ec85ed9280e11814.webm?t=1793137889" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/ad3f32604091bd40ec85ed9280e11814.mp4?t=1793137889" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Battle through Ash Chapel, Ember Sanctum and Veil Spire, and change the challenge with arenas that ask more of you than survival alone.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Restore sanctuaries among the hedges of Thorn Conservatory.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Cross into safety as the flooded lanes of Flooded Ossuary shift.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Protect wandering souls along Procession Road.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Face the bosses. Keep going.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/cfdb8f8363eb5042fc0c18d527c3e96b.poster.avif?t=1793137889" width=616 height=308 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/cfdb8f8363eb5042fc0c18d527c3e96b.webm?t=1793137889" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5248190/extras/cfdb8f8363eb5042fc0c18d527c3e96b.mp4?t=1793137889" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Read the warning lanes, dodge the charge, and find your opening against the Bell Colossus, Glass Seraph, Cinder Tyrant and the rest of Hell's boss roster.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Take on a three-stage campaign, then carry your surviving build into escalating Endless battles.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Earn Holy Gold and invest in permanent upgrades between runs.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Play solo or join a friend in 2-player online co-op.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><br><strong>100% free to play!</strong></h2></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
